  "claim": "The English actress, writer, and comedian who was a star in Girls on Top and in French and Saunders was born on 11 October 1957.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Girls on Top (TV series). Sentence: Girls on Top is a British ITV sitcom, broadcast in 1985 and 1986, and made by Witzend for the ITV contractor Central Independent Television.\nPage: Girls on Top (TV series). Sentence: It stars Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders, Ruby Wax and Tracey Ullman, and was written by French, Saunders, and Wax with additional material from Ullman.\nPage: Dawn French. Sentence: Dawn Roma French (born 11 October 1957) is an English actress, writer, and comedian.\nPage: Dawn French. Sentence: She is best known for starring in and writing for the comedy sketch show \"French and Saunders\" with comedy partner Jennifer Saunders and for playing the lead role as Geraldine Granger in the sitcom \"The Vicar of Dibley\".",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Girls on Top (TV series). Sentence: Girls on Top is a British ITV sitcom, broadcast in 1985 and 1986, and made by Witzend for the ITV contractor Central Independent Television.\nPage: Girls on Top (TV series). Sentence: It stars Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders, Ruby Wax and Tracey Ullman, and was written by French, Saunders, and Wax with additional material from Ullman.\nPage: Dawn French. Sentence: Dawn Roma French (born 11 October 1957) is an English actress, writer, and comedian.\nPage: Dawn French. Sentence: She is best known for starring in and writing for the comedy sketch show \"French and Saunders\" with comedy partner Jennifer Saunders and for playing the lead role as Geraldine Granger in the sitcom \"The Vicar of Dibley\".",
