        "original_id": "5a9cb816-317d-5a58-9d91-74c32ba080b5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders, Ruby Wax, Tracey Ullman\n- TV series: Girls on Top, French and Saunders, The Vicar of Dibley\n- Companies: ITV, Witzend, Central Independent Television\n- Roles: actress, writer, comedian\n\nFacts:\n- Dawn Roma French was born on 11 October 1957 and is an English actress, writer, and comedian.\n- Girls on Top is a British ITV sitcom that was broadcast in 1985 and 1986.\n- Girls on Top was made by Witzend for the ITV contractor Central Independent Television.\n- Girls on Top stars Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders, Ruby Wax, and Tracey Ullman.\n- Girls on Top was written by Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders, and Ruby Wax, with additional material from Tracey Ullman.\n- Dawn French is best known for starring in and writing for the comedy sketch show French and Saunders with Jennifer Saunders.\n- Dawn French is also known for playing Geraldine Granger in the sitcom The Vicar of Dibley.",
